  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Identifik&#xe1;cia potrieb a pr&#xed;prava projektov&#xfd;ch z&#xe1;merov v oblasti rozvoja po&#x13e;nohospod&#xe1;rstva s aspektom ochrany pr&#xed;rody a krajiny</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identifying needs and preparation of project objectives in the field of agricultural development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;&#x10d;ka sa bude venova&#x165; nasledovn&#xfd;m &#x10d;innostiam: - zmapovanie oblast&#xed;, kde existuje probl&#xe9;m pop&#xed;san&#xfd; vy&#x161;&#x161;ie - konzult&#xe1;cie s miestnymi komunitami, anal&#xfd;za potrieb - konzult&#xe1;cie s miestnymi rozvojov&#xfd;mi organiz&#xe1;ciami, zbieranie existuj&#xfa;cej expert&#xed;zy a sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; - konzult&#xe1;cie s predstavite&#x13e;mi miestnych org&#xe1;nov &#x161;t&#xe1;tnej spr&#xe1;vy a samospr&#xe1;vy, anal&#xfd;za potrieb, postojov a SWOT anal&#xfd;za - pr&#xed;prava projektov&#xfd;ch z&#xe1;merov, ktor&#xe9; n&#xe1;sledne m&#xf4;&#x17e;u by&#x165; adresovan&#xe9; r&#xf4;znym eur&#xf3;pskym a medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xfd;m donorom - nadviazanie osobn&#xfd;ch kontaktov a spolupr&#xe1;ce s predstavite&#x13e;mi partnerskej organiz&#xe1;cie - pr&#xed;prava aspo&#x148; jedn&#xe9;ho projektov&#xe9;ho n&#xe1;vrhu pre EK alebo in&#xe9;ho medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xe9;ho donora - propag&#xe1;cia Slovenskej republiky a slovensk&#xfd;ch subjektov ako profesion&#xe1;lnych rozvojov&#xfd;ch akt&#xe9;rov s ponukou zauj&#xed;mav&#xe9;ho know-how pre Gruz&#xed;nsko</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Volunteer will be engaged in the following activities: - Consultation with local communities, needs analysis - Consultation with local development organizations, collecting existing expertise and experience - Consultations with representatives of local authorities, state and local governments, needs analysis and SWOT Analysis - Preparation of project plans - Establish personal contacts and cooperation with representatives of partner organizations - Preparation of at least one project proposal to the European Commission or other international donor - Promotion of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </description>
